N1  - Presented at the Conference on Human Factors in Computer Systems, Gaithersburg, Maryland, 15–17 March 1982. Complete four-page institutional scan verified through Carnegie Mellon University Libraries. Local PDF SHA-256: ad3e9c1eca1afd999f4b0228e1c10e3f48b0062ef388a11175d846c29dae3c71. AI-assisted complete reading performed; thesis-author passage verification pending. The first connector import on 2026-08-14 used T2 for the proceedings title and T3 for CHI '82; Zotero therefore mapped them to Conference Name and Series. This preserved the information but requires a manual field correction in item IB78T2WL. This file now uses Zotero RIS mappings T2 = conferenceName and C3 = proceedingsTitle for reproducible future import.
